    "UDP packets are probably blocked. It is impossible to make or receive calls without that. Make sure that your local firewall and the firewall at your router allow UDP protocol.": {
      "comment": "Failed to communicate with STUN server informative text.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UDP packets are probably blocked. It is impossible to make or receive calls without that. Make sure that your local firewall and the firewall at your router allow UDP protocol."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UDP-Pakete werden anscheinend blockiert. Sie können weder Anrufe tätigen noch empfangen. Stellen Sie sicher, daß Ihre lokale Firewall und die Firewall Ihres Routers das UDP-Protokoll erlaubt."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Скорее всего, прохождение UDP-пакетов заблокировано, а без этого невозможно совершать звонки. Убедитесь, что на компьютере и на маршрутизаторе разрешен протокол UDP."
          }
        }
      }
    },
